{"ratings":[{"id":"C1","consequence":"outage","trigger":"normal","reason":"Routine confined suite skips prevent the workaround from accepting passing gate evidence, leaving verification blocked for human intervention."},{"id":"C2","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"Bun can run a different matching file while the factory reports the requested, unrun test as verified."},{"id":"C3","consequence":"outage","trigger":"normal","reason":"Common mentions of gates in independent evidence or shared notes can block passing criteria and stop the run."},{"id":"C4","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A setup command or earlier check can modify source before testing, causing the factory to credit passing results to a restored commit that fails the test."}]}